  "events": [
    {
      "text": "I am painting an imagined red pear on folded blue linen. The practice goal is a filled silhouette and one restrained light that survives at whole view. Cool cloth will carry the warm fruit; broad passes come before small accents.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10400,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The blue washes have soft granular edges, but pale seams split the ground into bands. I will bridge those gaps and establish a low cloth fold before placing the fruit.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7800,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The upper seam is reduced; the lower one remains, and the first oil fold is too line-like. I will place a broad pear body above it, then turn that line into the dark side of a fold.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9620,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The broad overlaps made a solid pear rather than a hollow contour. The neck is upright and the right shoulder abrupt. A curved shadow turn and a leaning stem should make the form less stiff.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9100,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The curved right shadow turns under the fruit and the stem makes its identity clear. The warm left pass is abrupt at its lower end. I will connect that into the belly and spread a lighter plane beside the dark cloth fold.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10920,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "The belly connects more smoothly. The wider cloth planes help, but their squared ends and straight ridge still dominate. I will soften the left end with a broad curved plane and deepen only the short contact beneath the pear.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10140,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "The contact sits close to the fold, and the left cloth end is less square. The pear has a broad warm light but no focal accent. I will test one short, low-body cream stroke on the upper-left shoulder.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9880,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "The 18 px light survives whole view as a small warm glint. Its location can stay. The upper neck still needs a gentler transition and a dark stem socket; I will develop those while leaving the light alone.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9880,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 22
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "The socket attaches the stem and the warm neck joins the shoulder. The pale background seam still cuts behind the lower fruit. Two outside washes will quiet that seam; a broad diagonal cloth pass will turn the stripe into a fold.",
